1
00:00:00,203 --> 00:00:01,243
LEONARD:
How so?

2
00:00:01,413 --> 00:00:02,743
SHELDON:
It has been some time...

3
00:00:02,914 --> 00:00:05,794
(Sheldon:)...since we've had a woman
take her clothes off in our apartment.

4
00:00:05,959 --> 00:00:07,959
(Sheldon:)That's not true.
Remember at Thanksgiving...

5
00:00:08,128 --> 00:00:11,168
(Leonard:)...my grandmother with Alzheimer's
had that episode?

6
00:00:12,382 --> 00:00:16,182
(Sheldon:)Point taken. It has been some time since
we've had a woman take her clothes off...

7
00:00:16,344 --> 00:00:19,014
(Sheldon:)...after which
we didn't wanna rip our eyes out.

8
00:00:19,931 --> 00:00:23,431
(Leonard:)The worst part
