9
00:00:23,852 --> 00:00:27,642
(Sheldon:)So, what exactly
are you trying to accomplish here?

10
00:00:27,814 --> 00:00:28,944
(Leonard:)Excuse me?

11
00:00:29,107 --> 00:00:31,697
(Sheldon:)That woman in there
is not going to have sex with you.

12
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,860
(Leonard:)Well, I'm not trying to have sex with her.

13
00:00:34,029 --> 00:00:36,739
(Sheldon:)Oh, good.
Then you won't be disappointed.

14
00:00:36,907 --> 00:00:39,237
(Leonard:)What makes you think
she wouldn't have sex with me?

15
00:00:39,409 --> 00:00:41,369
(Leonard:)I'm a male and she's a female.

16
00:00:41,870 --> 00:00:45,000
(Sheldon:)Yes, but not of the same species.

17
00:00:45,165 --> 00:00:47,245
I'm not gonna engage
in hypotheticals here.

18
00:00:47,417 --> 00:00:51,127
- I'm just trying to be a good neighbor.
- Oh, of course.

19
00:00:51,296 --> 00:00:54,386
(Leonard:)That's not to say that
if a carnal relationship were to develop...

20
00:00:54,549 --> 00:00:58,019
(Leonard:)...that I wouldn't participate.

